      <div className="shell sectionHead"><div><p className="sectionLabel">02 — SELECTED WORK</p><h2>Projects built to matter.</h2></div><p>Technology, education and sustainable design projects shown from concept to outcome. Real project photography can be added to every card.</p></div>
      <div className="projectGrid shell">{projects.map(project => <article className="project" key={project.number}>
        <ImageSlot image={project.image} label={`${project.title} project photo`} tone={project.tone} />
        <div className="projectBody"><small>{project.category}</small><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.description}</p><div className="tags">{project.tags.map(tag => <span key={tag}>{tag}</span>)}</div><a href="#contact">View project <span>↗</span></a></div>
      </article>)}</div>
    </section>

    <section className="education shell section" id="education">
      <div className="educationPhotos"><ImageSlot image={null} label="Children's STEM workshop" tone="kidsOne" className="largePhoto"/><ImageSlot image={null} label="Hands-on learning activity" tone="kidsTwo" className="smallPhoto"/></div>
      <div className="educationCopy"><p className="sectionLabel">03 — WORKING WITH CHILDREN</p><h2>Learning with fun<br />and understanding.</h2><p>I create safe and engaging learning environments where children explore ideas through play, building and experimentation. Activities are adapted to different ages and designed to strengthen curiosity, teamwork, confidence and problem-solving.</p><ul><li>Hands-on STEM workshops</li><li>Age-appropriate explanations</li><li>Teamwork and creative problem-solving</li><li>Learning through building and testing</li></ul></div>
    </section>

    <section className="expertise section"><div className="shell"><div className="sectionHead light"><div><p className="sectionLabel">04 — EXPERTISE</p><h2>Design. Build. Teach.</h2></div><p>A practical combination of product development and meaningful learning experiences.</p></div><div className="skillList">{expertise.map(([n,t,d]) => <div className="skillRow" key={n}><span>{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p><b>↗</b></div>)}</div></div></section>

    <section className="process shell section" id="process"><div className="sectionHead"><div><p className="sectionLabel">05 — DESIGN PROCESS</p><h2>From first sketch<br />to final outcome.</h2></div><p>The images in this section will show the actual evolution of your work: concept, early prototype, testing and final model.</p></div><div className="processSteps">{process.map(([n,t,d]) => <article key={n}><span>{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div><div className="processImages"><ImageSlot image={null} label="Concept sketches" tone="sketch"/><ImageSlot image={null} label="Early prototype" tone="prototype"/><ImageSlot image={null} label="Final product" tone="finalProduct"/></div></section>

    <section className="gallery section" id="gallery"><div className="shell"><div className="sectionHead"><div><p className="sectionLabel">06 — PROJECT GALLERY</p><h2>Real work. Real process.</h2></div><p>Send your photos and each placeholder will be replaced with the right project, workshop or production image.</p></div><div className="galleryGrid"><ImageSlot image={null} label="Workshop moment" tone="g1" className="tall"/><ImageSlot image={null} label="Industrial design" tone="g2"/><ImageSlot image={null} label="Prototype testing" tone="g3"/><ImageSlot image={null} label="Finished project" tone="g4" className="wide"/></div></div></section>

    <section className="contact" id="contact"><div className="shell contactInner"><p className="sectionLabel">07 — CONTACT</p><h2>Have an idea worth<br /><em>bringing to life?</em></h2><p>Let&apos;s talk about a project, workshop or opportunity to build something meaningful.</p><a className="contactButton" href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com <span>↗</span></a><div className="socials"><a href="#">LinkedIn</a><a href="#">GitHub</a><a href="#">Behance</a></div></div></section>
    <footer className="footer"><div className="shell"><span>© 2026 — Innovation Portfolio</span><span>Industrial Design · STEM · Prototyping</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>
  </main>;
